WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,740
Zhang Yi Zhang Yi

2
00:00:03,740 --> 00:00:05,740
Everyone needs you very much now

3
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,740
Please show your kindness and help everyone

4
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,740
Right, right, right

5
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:09,740
as long as you save us

6
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,740
Everyone is grateful to you

7
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:14,980
From now on, you have the final say in our building.

8
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:15,980
I do it for Uncle You’s sake

9
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:16,980
Just came to chat

10
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:20,260
But I don't bother to care about you at all.

11
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:22,460
I live well by myself

12
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,460
I still have to go out for similar activities

13
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,460
Risk your life

14
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,680
Not worth it

15
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,610
What do you want us to do in the future?

16
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:30,630
Whatever we do

17
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,890
Good, right?

18
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:33,890
I'll let you get your weapons

19
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:35,890
Go fight Tianhe Gang to death

20
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,890
Is it okay if you go or not?

21
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:39,890
From now on, everything will be done by me

22
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,890
Who dares to knock and hide silently?

23
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:42,890
Being a turtle

24
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:43,890
I want a dog to get up and pick fruits

25
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:44,890
found one

26
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:45,890
Kill it directly
